** Surface characteristics below are explicit illustrative assumptions, not AERSURFACE.
JOB
  MESSAGES aermet2.msg
  REPORT aermet2.rpt
SURFACE
  QAOUT surface.qa
  ASOS1MIN ../aerminute/clemson_1min.dat
UPPERAIR
  QAOUT upperair.qa
METPREP
  XDATES 2023/01/01 TO 2023/12/31
  NWS_HGT WIND 7.92
  METHOD REFLEVEL SUBNWS
  OUTPUT clemson.sfc
  PROFILE clemson.pfl
  FREQ_SECT ANNUAL 1
  SECTOR 1 0 360
  SITE_CHAR 1 1 0.20 1.0 0.10
